# Secrets directory — managed by SOPS + age
# See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for details
#
# Files here are encrypted at rest in git. Plaintext versions are
# written to ~/.config/ by dotfiles.sh at apply time.
#
# Quick reference:
#   Edit:    sops secrets/<file>
#   Encrypt: sops --encrypt --in-place secrets/<file>
#   Decrypt: sops --decrypt secrets/<file>
